<title>USA: America's Health in program deal with Cox.</title>
<headline>America's Health in program deal with Cox.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>America's Health Network on Wednesday said it signed a multiyear deal to provide its programming to Cox Communications Inc's 3.2 million cable television subscribers.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>With the Cox deal, America's Health has agreements with seven of the top-10 U.S. multiple cable systems operators, representing a total of 42 million subscribers.</p>
